type: software
title: "The Coordinate Pythagorean Theorem from Planar Isotropy: An Axiomatic Derivation with Lie-Theoretic Extensions"
authors:
  - family-names: Odasso
    given-names: Alessandro
abstract: >-
  Lean 4/Mathlib formalization of a conditional axiomatic derivation
  of the coordinate Pythagorean theorem from primitive length congruence
  and planar symmetries. Alessandro Odasso initiated the research question;
  the accompanying mathematical manuscript was generated by OpenAI ChatGPT
  (GPT-6, High thinking effort), and the formalization and revisions were
  AI-assisted. Formal verification establishes the theorems under their
  stated assumptions, not historical novelty or axiom minimality.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
